    "notes": "Stripped all physical-inventory and vendor tasks (presets/courses are digital); removed payment reminders (digital purchases are instant-pay); slowed daily social cadence to weekly (a solo photographer can't sustain daily posts); added before/after visual content, preset trend research, course student support, free-sample lead nurture, wedding booking sales follow-up, and client gallery delivery as the idea's genuine differentiators."
